      <div class="letter-wrap">
        <div class="letter-date">// date_17 · opened at last ♡</div>
        <div class="letter-body">
          <p>Knowing you and knowing how curious and stubbord you are, Aki. I know this wouldn't be the last thing you would open like what the name says, thats why I decided to put a lock hehe. Anyways that means you went through everything else already. The bugs, the drafts, the settings panel. I hope you smiled, I hope you enjoy it. I hope somewhere in the middle of the funny parts, something landed differently than expected.</p>
          <p>I want to say something that I think is actually hard to say. No not because it's complicated, but because it's <span class="highlight">very simple, and simple things can feel the most exposing</span>.</p>
          <p>I see you. Not in a grand or dramatic way. It's just, I do notice. I notice the way you hold things in because you need to be the one to process them on your own and because you feel like you would be too much for others. I notice the way you're funny right when something is getting too real, like a nililipat yung topic. I notice that you feel deeply and the qay you goes quiet and change tone. And <span class="highlight">I think that's one of the most honest things about you.</span></p>
          <p>I don't need you to change any of that. I'm not waiting for a version of you that's louder about her feelings or easier to read. I like the version of you that is not direct but are open. The version that says "I'm fine" and means "I'm working on it." The version that shows up despite everything. Quietly, imperfectly, and <span class="highlight2">consistently.</span></p>
          <p>Iris is our song because I think you understand it in a way most people don't. That line "I don't want the world to see me, 'cause I don't think that they'd understand." You've lived inside that feeling. And still, <span class="highlight">you let me in a little at a time</span>, which is actually the braver thing.</p>
          <p>We already did 17 dates (including this one right now). And every single one, I leave wanting more of exactly this. Not a different version. This one.</p>
          <p>Happy 17th. You don't have to say anything big back. You never do. <span class="highlight2">Just being here is enough. It always has been.</span> Thank you for everything my Aki.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="letter-sign">with everything I have, <span>— kenny ♡</span></div>
        <div class="letter-ps">
